<title>UK: Graham names Dean Moore finance director.</title>
<headline>Graham names Dean Moore finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building materials distributor Graham Group Plc said in a statement on Wednesday that Dean Moore will succeed Bob Elsmore as finance director at the company's annual general meeting in the late spring of 1997.</p>
<p>Dean was formerly finance director of the chemists' division of the drugstore chain Lloyds Chemists Plc.</p>
<p>Elsmore, who is due to retire, has held the post of finance director since 1993.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
